      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊，这实在是太可惜了！\r\n粉丝们也希望能再度看见您如高峰小姐那般\r\n活跃在樱花赏和日本橡树大赛上！",
      "source_fingerprint": "09c9e8485116101c95fd059cc649353cebc08e6af8b5c86cf9254b9e4b7e2ab7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
