      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便只能散发出再微弱不过的光芒也无妨……\r\n我的双脚终究与姐姐不同，\r\n无法完成如她那般的伟业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e29f35ec63768fa208fbabc75a55edaaa72f9b0f9d8f1e7e73fa442c70571f15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069113.json",
      "json_path": [
