    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b399e7516a543004a182cfe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这天，八重无敌正在大雪仍未融化的深山中，\r\n与自然对峙着，磨练着自身的“武道”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0781672b5b9fc3961bdff151581ed604d9dba2a56078ef8c93ded2e88b7ce973",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
